  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Use of Statistics Norway for Tax for Development - co-ordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Norway will lead the planning project in close cooperation with relevant institutions in the partner countries. Since this is a pre-project to plan for a long-term collaboration, planning will constitute a significant part of the project&#x2019;s resources. The work will involve among other things  internal meetings in Statistics Norway to clarify availability and plan use of experts on relevant technical cooperation areas and to develop the project plan for a long-term institutional cooperation project under Tax for development programme.</narrative>
  </description>
